{
  "slug": "forgeproof",
  "name": "Forgeproof",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ForgeProof turns GitHub issues into working, AI-generated code backed by a tamper-evident receipt. \n\nClaude Code reads the issue, extracts requirements, writes code and tests, then seals everything into a signed .rpack provenance bundle. \n\nThe bundle proves what was done, why, and that nothing was altered after signing — a cryptographic receipt that travels with the code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `push` (Push a ForgeProof branch and open a pull request with provenance metadata embedded in the PR description), `reset` (Clean up ForgeProof local state for an issue or all issues), `run` (Create provenance-tracked code from a GitHub issue with a cryptographically signed audit trail), `verify` (Verify a ForgeProof provenance bundle (.rpack file))\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install forgeproof@claude-community` from `ryanjmichie-git/forgeproof-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ryan Michie"
  },
